Reading: before 606c4accd (wm_level-1 warp injection) the port coded NO
warped block at preset 0, where C codes WARPED_CAUSAL on 6-26 % of inter
blocks. The injection made warped reachable; the OBMC count fell by 20-22 on
each cell as blocks moved to warped, and both shares moved toward C's.
Recon == dav1d held 2/2 on every cell in CI run 36203734807. The port's
partition tree still differs from C's at p0 (296 vs 959 coded blocks), so C's
absolute counts are not the gate's contract (see the gate header).

The earlier count "80" for vidyo1 256 before the change is the port's count at
606c4accd^; the gate pinned 76 (its 2026-09-20 measurement).
